25/491818890_1185396466902687_3485502356355162100_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1iOnlKrLwPoQ7kNvwGKkzDP&_nc_oc=AdpLmWJo56K1rMiRRmVv0w1J9vNdKA0E_Rhv2K6kx378TVRHzoTsDnN801IqFpA_tLk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJWGHq_fzyyi3dkrqKZfcb7WWT0RrazHYRnAxTuxsb6wA&oe=6A9AC872"}, "display_name": "Irusu Cricket VR", "keywords": ["Cricket", "Sports", "Batting", "T20", "Physics"], "long_description": "IRUSU CRICKET VR: THE ULTIMATE QUEST 3 EXPERIENCE\n\nStep onto the pitch with a true-to-life, physics-driven VR cricket simulation built exclusively for Meta Quest 3 and 3s.\n\nREAL BATTING PHYSICS\nExperience 1:1 VR bat tracking. The game calculates sweet spots and power directly from your actual swing. Controller haptics let you physically feel a clean drive versus a thick edge.\n\nSMART AI & REAL MATCHES\nFace 150 km/h bouncers and sharp spin from adaptive AI bowlers. Watch fielders dive for catches in real-time. Play 3, 5, 10, or 20-over matches complete with Power Plays and Super Overs.\n\nTV-STYLE DRS SYSTEM\nChallenge the umpire! Watch cinematic Hawk-Eye, Ultra-Edge (Snicko), and HotSpot reviews unfold on the stadium Jumbotron.\n\nGLOBAL STADIUMS & PROGRESSION\nMaster your swing in Net Practice, then conquer unique pitches in Mumbai, Melbourne, and London. Unlock premium gear, track your stats, and immerse yourself in dynamic crowd roars.\n\nKEY FEATURES:\n- 1:1 physics-based batting\n- Adaptive AI bowling & active fielding\n- 3rd Umpire DRS (Hawk-Eye, Snicko, HotSpot)\n- Quick matches to full T20 formats\n- 3 iconic stadiums & Net Practice mode\n- Bat skins, career stats & haptic feedback\n- Feel every ball. Own every shot.", "short_description": "Step onto the crease. Face AI bowlers. Play VR cricket like never before."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.irusu.co.in/privacy-policy-2/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Irusu Studios", "support_website_url": 